<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Petrobras 1996 net 664 mln reais - report.</title>
<headline>Brazil Petrobras 1996 net 664 mln reais - report.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's state-owned energy monopoly Petrobras reported a net profit of 664 million reais in 1996, up from 570 million reais in 1995, local newswire Invest News said.</p>
<p>In 1996, the company's revenues totalled 16.872 billion reais and its assets were worth 20 billion reais at the end of the year, the report said.</p>
<p>No one was available at Petrobras to confirm the information.</p>
<p>(( --William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358))</p>
